<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan 1996 industrial output up 1.7 pct vs 1995.</title>
<headline>Taiwan 1996 industrial output up 1.7 pct vs 1995.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's industrial output in 1996 rose 1.7 percent compared to 1995, according to a rough estimate released on Monday by the economics ministry.</p>
<p>Official figures would be released later, the ministry said.</p>
</text>
